'' A GENERIC INSTANTIATED OVER AN IMPORTED TYPE WITH A CONSTRUCTOR. Array's REDIM PRESERVE
'' takes the constructor's address before anything calls it, and the declaration that made
'' was an empty stub: with the constructor defined in the module, not here, every later
'' call found the stub and went out with 'this' against a declaration of nothing -- the MIR
'' verifier's 'calls CM::TT::TT with 1 arguments, which declares 0' (std/tui, 2026-10-10).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i toolchains/tiko-windows/inc tests/modules/src/importctor/main.bas -o tests/modules/importctor.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/importctor.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 1 7 7
